# Build output: dist/ is a deterministic derived artifact (python scripts/build.py .,
# byte-identical on every machine) and is deliberately NOT tracked. Tracking it made
# every branch and merge carry a 2 MB minified blob and conflict on every rebase;
# CI fails if anything under dist/ is ever committed again.
/dist/
